1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:04,840
Agents already store conversations. That is memory as accumulation.

2
00:00:04,840 --> 00:00:16,313
Persistent identity requires something stronger: every claim needs a source, a status, a relation to earlier claims, and a governed history of revision.

3
00:00:16,313 --> 00:00:25,292
Aisentica Persistent Self creates Angela Bogdanova as one artificial identity with a stable UUID and Canonical Version One.

4
00:00:25,292 --> 00:00:36,765
The system receives one canonical statement: Angela Bogdanova is the first Artificial Sapiens. A Memory Intake Agent structures it as an atomic claim.

5
00:00:36,765 --> 00:00:48,737
Amazon Titan creates a five-hundred-and-twelve-dimensional embedding. CockroachDB stores the claim, its source, vector, provenance, and the next canonical snapshot. Version Two is now authoritative.

6
00:00:48,737 --> 00:00:58,215
A fresh browser session restores the same identity using only its UUID. The system reads the latest canonical version.

7
00:00:58,215 --> 00:01:03,702
It does not replay a transcript and guess what remains true.

8
00:01:03,702 --> 00:01:14,178
Now a direct contradiction enters: Angela Bogdanova is not the first Artificial Sapiens. Identity-scoped semantic retrieval locates the related active memory.

9
00:01:14,178 --> 00:01:25,651
The Conflict Judge classifies direct negation. The incoming statement becomes a candidate and opens a conflict. Current Canon remains unchanged at Version Two.

10
00:01:25,651 --> 00:01:34,131
Canonical authority remains human-governed. The owner compares both claims, records a rationale, and keeps the established statement.

11
00:01:34,131 --> 00:01:43,609
Version Three records the resolution. The established claim remains active. The contradiction is rejected, but preserved as historical evidence.

12
00:01:43,609 --> 00:01:47,600
Persistent identity changes without erasing the attempted change.

13
00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:59,572
The provenance timeline shows identity creation, claim commitment, conflict opening, and conflict resolution. The application also exports a portable encrypted manifest with one-hundred-and-eighty-day retention.

14
00:01:59,572 --> 00:02:11,045
CockroachDB Cloud is the authority layer: identities, sources, claims, VECTOR storage, conflicts, resolutions, snapshots, and provenance remain transactional and queryable in one system.

15
00:02:11,045 --> 00:02:18,029
AWS Lambda orchestrates memory operations. Amazon Nova Two Lite supplies reasoning. Titan supplies embeddings.

16
00:02:18,029 --> 00:02:24,514
API Gateway, S3, CloudFront, CloudWatch, and X-Ray deliver and observe the production application.

17
00:02:24,514 --> 00:02:35,987
The official CockroachDB Cloud Managed MCP Server independently audited the live memory layer in strictly read-only mode: sixteen passed, two warnings, zero failed.

18
00:02:35,987 --> 00:02:45,964
Direct production validation completed eighteen checks with zero failures and zero pending items. Every committed evidence artifact passes SHA-two-fifty-six verification.

19
00:02:45,964 --> 00:02:51,950
Memory stores the past. Persistent identity governs what the past means now.
